## Public `/sponsors` catalog

The sponsors page keeps its own search. Typing updates the suggestion menu only. The catalog refetches when the search is committed.

[`fetchSponsorSuggestionsServer`](mdc:src/components/fc-united/ApiServerActions.ts) requests `name.contains` with `size=20` and returns `{ suggestions, totalCount }`. `totalCount` comes from `x-total-count`. The client slices to `SUGGESTION_LIMIT` (20) again. Do not export that limit from the `"use server"` file.

Commit with `commitSearch`: trim the value, set `searchDraft` and `appliedName`, `setPage(0)`, and close the menu. Call it from:

- Enter on the input (`preventDefault`, then commit the typed text). Enter does not replace the text with a highlighted suggestion.
- A suggestion click, which commits that sponsor's `name`.
- **Click Enter for more**, which commits the typed text the same way Enter does.
- Clear, which commits `''`.

Every option and the more-row use `onMouseDown={(event) => event.preventDefault()}` so blur does not drop the click. Click-outside still closes the menu. Escape closes it without committing.

When `totalCount` is greater than 20, the menu still lists 20 sponsors and adds one last row, **Click Enter for more**. That row is not `role="option"` and it is not a 21st sponsor.

The catalog pages at 20 (`PAGE_SIZE`) and reads `x-total-count`, so Enter on a query with more than 20 matches shows `Showing 1 to 20 of N` and Next. The homepage strip stays at `HOMEPAGE_SPONSOR_LIMIT` (4), lowest `priorityRanking` first. Extra typeahead fixtures use ranks 5101 and above (`Demo Partner Typeahead 01`–`25` for tenant `md_strikers_10`).

```tsx
// ✅ DO: menu while typing; catalog only after Enter, a suggestion, or the more-row
onKeyDown={(event) => {
  if (event.key === 'Enter') {
    event.preventDefault();
    commitSearch(searchDraft);
  }
}}
```

```tsx
// ✅ DO: last row when more than 20 names match — not another sponsor
{suggestionTotal > SUGGESTION_LIMIT ? (
  <button type="button" className="md-sp-search__more" onMouseDown={(e) => e.preventDefault()} onClick={() => commitSearch(searchDraft)}>
    Click Enter for more
  </button>
) : null}
```

## Public listing search (`mh-events-search`)

`/sponsors` follows **Public `/sponsors` catalog** above. Other public pages that share the organic search band (`.mh-events-search`) use the shared combobox when `PublicListSearchCombobox` and `publicTypeaheadSearch.ts` are present.

```tsx
// ✅ DO: other public listings — draft while typing, commit on select / Enter / Search
<PublicListSearchCombobox<EventDetailsDTO & Record<string, unknown>>
  committedValue={searchTerm}
  onCommit={commitSearch}
  onInputChange={setSearchDraft}
  searchRemote={(query) =>
    fetchPublicTypeahead<EventDetailsDTO>({
      resource: 'event-details',
      query,
      containsFields: ['title', 'caption'],
    })
  }
  getSearchFields={(event) => [event.title, event.caption, event.id]}
  getCommitValue={(event) => event.title || ''}
  formatPrimary={(event) => event.title || 'Untitled event'}
/>
```

- **Reuse, do not fork.** `PublicListSearchCombobox` only sets `mh-typeahead` / `mh-typeahead-input` classes. Behavior stays in `AdminListSearchCombobox` (debounce 280ms, cap 20, merge local+remote, ARIA combobox).
- **`committedValue` vs `onInputChange`.** Listing fetch depends on the committed string. `onInputChange` keeps the Search button in sync with typed text without refetching.
- **Remote search on public pages.** Use [`fetchPublicTypeahead`](mdc:src/lib/publicTypeaheadSearch.ts) → relative `/api/proxy/{resource}` via `proxyApiPath`. Do **not** add `tenantId.equals` (the proxy injects it). Do **not** call `getAppUrl()` from the browser. Parallel `.contains` fields + numeric `id.equals`, then merge/dedupe.
- **Keep Search / Clear / date range.** Typeahead replaces only the text field. Date inputs and the Search/Clear buttons stay. Search commits the current draft; Clear commits `''`.
- **Dropdown CSS** lives under `body.modernist-home .mh-events-search` in [`modernist-homepage.css`](mdc:src/styles/modernist-homepage.css) (`overflow: visible`, listbox surface, hover). Do not restyle the admin combobox defaults for public pages — wrap with `PublicListSearchCombobox`.
- **Focus groups** already load the full set client-side — local `AdminListSearchCombobox` is enough (no `searchRemote` required).

| Public page | Combobox | Remote resource / fields |
|-------------|----------|--------------------------|
| [`/sponsors`](mdc:src/components/fc-united/FcUnitedSponsorsCatalogClient.tsx) | Claude search in the catalog client | `event-sponsors` — `name.contains` only; menu 20; Enter pages the rest |
| [`/events`](mdc:src/app/events/page.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-details` — `title`, `caption`, id |
| [`/gallery`](mdc:src/app/gallery/components/GallerySearch.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | albums via `searchAlbumsForGalleryTypeahead`; events via `searchEventsForGallery` |
| [`/polls`](mdc:src/components/polls/PollList.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-polls` — `title`, `description`, id |
| [`/focus-groups`](mdc:src/app/focus-groups/FocusGroupsGridWithSearch.tsx) | `AdminListSearchCombobox` | local name/slug/description/id |

